# IPC specification

This document defines the expected communication boundaries between Daemon-Core and external systems.

## Purpose

IPC adapters isolate protocol-specific logic and keep services framework-neutral.

## Supported adapters

- Hyprland IPC
- DBus IPC
- PipeWire IPC
- NetworkManager IPC
- BlueZ IPC

## Allowed responsibilities

- workspace queries
- audio state
- network state
- Bluetooth discovery
- power state
- notification transport

## Forbidden responsibilities

- UI rendering
- business logic execution in adapters
- direct storage of app state

## Rule

IPC adapters are transport layers only. Business logic belongs to services.



